With an endometrial thickness of 12 mm on ultrasoound, false positive pregnancy test result is less likely. If the woman is not pregnant and she is experiencing just a normal menstruation at the 6th week (as she often does according to the history)
the endometrial thickness would be expected to be 2-4 mm.
