alcohol every day. Which one of the following is the most appropriate next investigation to reach a cause for this presentation?',NULL,'C','Intrauterine adhesions are a common complication of curettage. Approximately 90% cases of severe intrauterine adhesions are related to curettage for pregnancy complications such as missed or incomplete abortion, postpartum hemorrhage, or
retained placental tissue.
Intrauterine adhesions can be asymptomatic and of no clinical significance. If there are symptoms they can include:
Infertility
Menstrual irregularities (amenorrhea)
Cyclic pelvic pain
Recurrent miscarriages
When intrauterine adhesions are suspected, transvaginal ultrasonography is the next best investigation to confirm the diagnosis. Although not always necessary, diagnostic hysteroscopy remains the gold standard diagnostic investigation.',NULL,'Retain the source-era answer for question-bank study; verify current Australian guidance before clinical use.',NULL,NULL,'2023','v2.9.4',1,'text','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"599","duplicate_group_id":"exact-08743bb41c90","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"3687da22cd6cb8f32a7a","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":905,"source_qid":"599"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','high') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET source_id=excluded.source_id,source_question_no=excluded.source_question_no,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,system=excluded.system,topic=excluded.topic,clinical_task=excluded.clinical_task,stem_en=excluded.stem_en,answer_key=excluded.answer_key,source_explanation_en=excluded.source_explanation_en,memory_rule_en=excluded.memory_rule_en,image_ref=excluded.image_ref,source_year=excluded.source_year,import_version=excluded.import_version,active=1,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk;
