 with anovulatory cycles start ovulation on medical management and of those, 50% conceive within 6 to 9 months.\n(Option A) Low or zero sperm counts, poor sperm motility and dysmorphic sperms can all cause infertility. Fertility drugs for promotion of sperm production, artificial insemination with donor sperm and intracytoplasmic injection of sperm can be used\nas treatment modalities, but success rate is low (less than 25%).\n(Options B and D) Obstruction of or damage to the Fallopian tubes follows pelvic inflammatory disease, prior surgery, or tuberculosis and prevents the sperm from reaching to the ovum. Laparoscopic surgery is used to treat tubal obstructions or\nadhesions. Success rates of conception vary widely from a minimum of 10% to a maximum of 70% depending on the severity of the blockage.\n(Option E) Turner syndrome is associated with ovarian dysgenesis and infertility. There is no option for treatment of gonadal dysgenesis and reversal of infertility. Success rate is very low even after egg donation due to high rate of miscarriages.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","drug","management","treatment"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"very_high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"2152da023f9542c9d1d9a8b7776c3e4e668122a7","duplicate_group_id":"exact-2152da023f95","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"d2c2dd7aaab8e19e1604","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":933,"source_qid":"123"}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
