acid 0.5 mg daily or a multivitamin containing at least 0.4 mg of folic acid.\nWomen should take 10 times the minimal dose (4 to 5 mg per day) if:\nThere is a family, or personal history of neural tube defects (NTDs) or a previous pregnancy with NTD\nUse of medications that affect folic acid absorption e.g. antiepileptic medications\nDiabetes (type I/II)\nMother’s BMI>35 kg/m2\nAccording to National Health and Medical Research Council (NHMRC), the father’s personal history of NTDs is another condition requiring prescription if high dose folic acid.\nThe above recommendations apply for women with all current nutritional status, and being a vegetarian does not exclude her. Therefore, she should be started on folic acid\nsupplementation 0.4 to 0.5 mg per day. She should also be advised to include more green vegetables in her diet if she already has not.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","diabetes","dose","pregnan"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"very_high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"a2acd55c9f8e94ee6377c05904ed804fb5814368","duplicate_group_id":"exact-a2acd55c9f8e","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"681edc71c32109697289","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":939,"source_qid":"669"}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
